title: "xsm handover when A is in several teams"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: running
    lg1: clean
    lg2: split
    lg3: Breaks BCanReachWhatMoved or NoPlaceLeftBehind or PlaceAndItemsMoveTogether
    lg4: Path to the BCanReachWhatMoved or NoPlaceLeftBehind or PlaceAndItemsMoveTogether bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Not started: A in t1#59; boards moved in no team#59; B took A's place in no team
  s1: Running: A in t1#59; boards moved in no team#59; B took A's place in no team
  s2: Running: A in t1#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in no team
  s3: Running: A in no team#59; boards moved in no team#59; B took A's place in no team
  s4: Running: A in t1 and t2#59; boards moved in no team#59; B took A's place in no team
  s5: Running: A in no team#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in no team
  s6: Running: A in t1 and t2#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in no team
  s7: Handover stopped by an error: A in no team#59; boards moved in no team#59; B took A's place in no team
  s8: Running: A in no team#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in t1
  s9: Running: A in t1#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in t2
  s10: Running: A in t2#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in t1
  s11: Handover done: A in no team#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in no team
  s12: Handover done: A in no team#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in t1
  s13: Running: A in no team#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in t1 and t2
  s14: Handover done: A in t2#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in t1
  s15: Handover done: A in no team#59; boards moved in t1#59; B took A's place in t1 and t2
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the handover lists A's teams for the boards
  s1 --> s2: A's items in one team are moved to B
  s1 --> s3: someone removes A from a team
  s1 --> s4: someone adds A to another team
  s2 --> s2: the handover lists A's teams again
  s2 --> s5: someone removes A from a team
  s2 --> s6: someone adds A to another team
  s3 --> s7: A's items cannot be moved: A has left that team
  s4 --> s6: A's items in one team are moved to B
  s2 --> s8: B takes A's place in one team
  s5 --> s5: the handover lists A's teams again
  s6 --> s9: B takes A's place in one team
  s6 --> s10: B takes A's place in one team
  s5 --> s8: B takes A's place in one team
  s5 --> s11: the handover is recorded
  s8 --> s12: the handover is recorded
  s8 --> s10: someone adds A to another team
  s9 --> s13: B takes A's place in one team
  s10 --> s13: B takes A's place in one team
  s10 --> s14: the handover is recorded
  s13 --> s15: the handover is recorded
